---
description: Never attribute commits/issues/PRs to Cursor Agent (no Co-authored-by / Made-with)
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Cursor attribution (constitution Principle X)

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: Cursor Agent`, or any `*@cursor.com` / `*@cursor.so` trailer to commits.
- Never add `Made-with: Cursor` / `Made with Cursor` (or similar) to commit messages, **GitHub issue** bodies, or **PR/MR** bodies.
- When creating commits, issues, or PRs, use only the user's git / GitHub identity; do not invent co-authors for the agent.
